                <p class="text-flora-textMuted text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                    Welcome to Cafe De Flora. Savor authentic Neapolitan pizzas, exquisite small bites, handcrafted drinks, and seasonal culinary creations in a charming floral sanctuary.
                </p>
                
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="#menu" class="bg-flora-burgundy text-flora-gold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest shadow-lg hover:bg-flora-burgundyDark transition-all">
                        Explore Full Menu
                    </a>
                    <button onclick="openUploadModal()" class="bg-flora-bg text-flora-burgundy border border-flora-burgundy px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest shadow hover:bg-flora-card transition-all">
